    {
      "id": "a66fc538-fa51-477d-8fe7-284330753df1",
      "name": "Why MCP is Awesome: Bridging AI and Code",
      "path": "WWW / Blog / Why MCP is Awesome: Bridging AI and Code",
      "docTypeId": "a27d1370-d26c-4c1d-8cab-4206b9147782",
      "templateId": "57b4ab07-fe4d-4e6d-9dd3-0ff2ae1139a0",
      "state": "Draft",
      "domains": [],
      "values": [
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "title",
          "value": "Why MCP is Awesome: Bridging AI and Code"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextArea",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "excerpt",
          "value": "MCP is a revolutionary protocol that enables AI assistants to seamlessly access tools, APIs, and context from any application."
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "featuredImage",
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "7d2debe5-5632-4f9e-bd6c-32447b6213f9",
              "mediaKey": "7d2debe5-5632-4f9e-bd6c-32447b6213f9",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "content",
          "value": {
            "markup": "<p>MCP stands for Model Context Protocol. Instead of AI models being isolated, MCP creates standardized connections between language models and the tools they need.</p><p><strong>What makes MCP awesome:</strong></p><ul><li>Universal Integration with any backend service</li><li>Rich Context from real-time data and business systems</li><li>Composable tools that chain together</li><li>Standardized Protocol across all AI platforms</li></ul><p>The impact is profound. Developers can build AI applications truly connected to their systems.</p>",
            "blocks": {
              "layout": {},
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": []
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "urls": [],
      "docType": "blogPost",
      "template": "blogPost"
    },
    {
      "id": "d96fd8f8-e19e-4068-a21a-e859088d8c0a",
      "name": "MCP: The Future of AI Integrations",
      "path": "WWW / Blog / MCP: The Future of AI Integrations",
      "docTypeId": "a27d1370-d26c-4c1d-8cab-4206b9147782",
      "templateId": "57b4ab07-fe4d-4e6d-9dd3-0ff2ae1139a0",
      "state": "Draft",
      "domains": [],
      "values": [
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "title",
          "value": "MCP: The Future of AI Integrations"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextArea",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "excerpt",
          "value": "Model Context Protocol represents a paradigm shift in how AI systems access and interact with business applications and data."
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "featuredImage",
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "7c64ef10-eae0-4ebc-aca7-c505a786e2c7",
              "mediaKey": "7c64ef10-eae0-4ebc-aca7-c505a786e2c7",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "content",
          "value": {
            "markup": "<p>MCP is transforming AI integration from a custom, fragmented landscape into a unified ecosystem.</p><p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Reduced Complexity:</strong> One standard protocol instead of custom APIs for each AI platform</li><li><strong>Faster Development:</strong> Connect your systems to AI in minutes, not weeks</li><li><strong>Better Security:</strong> Standardized protocols mean better auditing and control</li><li><strong>Platform Independence:</strong> Works with Claude, ChatGPT, and future AI models</li></ul><p>With MCP, building AI-powered applications has never been more accessible. The protocol handles the complexity so you can focus on value.</p>",
            "blocks": {
              "layout": {},
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": []
            }
          }
        }
      ],
